              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.46.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "46:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maana BWANA asema hivi, Tazama, nitakufanya kuwa hofu kuu kwa nafsi yako, na kwa rafiki zako wote; nao wataanguka kwa upanga wa adui zao, na macho yako yataona hayo; nami nitatia Yuda yote katika mikono ya mfalme wa Babeli, naye atawachukua mateka mpaka Babeli, na kuwaua kwa upanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.20.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Fal 20:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.3.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 3:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tena mali zote za mji huu, na mapato yake yote, na vitu vyake vya thamani vyote pia, naam, hazina zote za wafalme wa Yuda, nitavitia katika mikono ya adui zao, watakaowateka nyara, na kuwakamata, na kuwachukua mpaka Babeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:6"
