                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maana nimesikia mashutumu ya watu wengi; hofu ziko pande zote. Rafiki zangu wote, wanaonivizia nisite, husema, Mshitaki, nasi tutamshitaki, huenda akahadaika, nasi tutamshinda, tutajilipiza kisasi kwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.10"
            ]
          }
